  "html": "<div style=\"min-height:800px;overflow:clip;background:#000;color:white;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\"><nav style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 48px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:white;\">thoughtful</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\">About Thoughtful</span></nav><div data-el=\"setup-steps\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:18px 48px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"display:flex;\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:999px;background:white;color:#000;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;\">&#10003;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Submit profile details</span></div><span style=\"flex:0 0 40px;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\"></span><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"display:flex;\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:999px;background:white;color:#000;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Connect calendars</span></div></div><main style=\"max-width:720px;padding:36px 48px 48px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\"><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.15;color:white;margin:0 0 8px;\">Connect your calendars</h1><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:white;\">Connected calendars</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Google Calendar</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:white;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:none;\">Connect</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Outlook</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:white;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:none;\">Connect</span></div></div><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:0;\">If you use SimplePractice, sync it to one of these calendars first.</p><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:0;\">Busy time on every calendar you connect is subtracted from your working hours.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:white;\">Working hours</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Time zone</span><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;max-width:360px;\">Eastern Time (ET)</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:184px 150px 150px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:3px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:999px;background:#000;margin-left:18px;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Monday</span></div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">9:00 AM</div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">5:00 PM</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:184px 150px 150px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:3px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:999px;background:#000;margin-left:18px;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Tuesday</span></div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">9:00 AM</div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">5:00 PM</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:184px 150px 150px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:3px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:999px;background:#000;margin-left:18px;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Wednesday</span></div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">9:00 AM</div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">5:00 PM</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:184px 150px 150px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:3px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:999px;background:#000;margin-left:18px;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Thursday</span></div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">9:00 AM</div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">5:00 PM</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:184px 150px 150px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:3px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-left:0;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Friday</span></div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">Unavailable</div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">&mdash;</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:184px 150px 150px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:3px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-left:0;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Saturday</span></div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">Unavailable</div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">&mdash;</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:184px 150px 150px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:3px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-left:0;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Sunday</span></div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">Unavailable</div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">&mdash;</div></div></div></div><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:0;\">Set the hours you&#39;re willing to see members each week. You can change them any time in the Provider Portal.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:32px;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\">Times are in your time zone (Eastern Time)</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:white;color:#000;border-radius:999px;padding:14px 24px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:none;\">Finish setup</span></div></main><footer style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 48px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><p style=\"font-size:12px;opacity:0.7;color:white;margin:0;\">&copy; Thoughtful &middot; Provider Portal</p><p style=\"font-size:12px;opacity:0.7;color:white;margin:0;\">Need help? Email providers@springhealth.com</p></footer><div style=\"position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:10;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"width:420px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);color:#1b1b1b;\"><div style=\"background:#f3f3f3;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:999px;background:#ff5f57;display:inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:999px;background:#febc2e;display:inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:999px;background:#28c840;display:inline-block;\"></span></span><span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#5e5e5e;\">login.microsoftonline.com/</span></div><div style=\"padding:26px 28px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:12px 12px;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"background:#f25022;width:12px;height:12px;\"></span><span style=\"background:#7fba00;width:12px;height:12px;\"></span><span style=\"background:#00a4ef;width:12px;height:12px;\"></span><span style=\"background:#ffb900;width:12px;height:12px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#5e5e5e;\">Microsoft</span></div><h2 style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin:12px 0 0;color:#1b1b1b;\">Permissions requested</h2><span style=\"font-size:15px;color:#1b1b1b;\">This app would like to:</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:15px;color:#1b1b1b;\"><span style=\"color:#5e5e5e;\">&#8964;</span><span>Maintain access to data you have given it access to</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:15px;color:#1b1b1b;\"><span style=\"color:#5e5e5e;\">&#8964;</span><span>Have full access to user calendars</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:15px;color:#1b1b1b;\"><span style=\"color:#5e5e5e;\">&#8964;</span><span>View users&#39; basic profile</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:#1b1b1b;\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:3px;background:#1b5fb5;color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;\">&#10003;</span>Consent on behalf of your organization</div><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5e5e5e;margin:0;\">Accepting these permissions lets this app read your calendar busy time and your name and email.</p><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;\"><span style=\"background:#c8c8c8;color:#1b1b1b;padding:9px 26px;font-size:14px;\">Cancel</span><span style=\"background:#1b5fb5;color:#ffffff;padding:9px 26px;font-size:14px;\">Accept</span></div></div></div><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);margin:14px 0 0;text-align:center;max-width:420px;\">Native calendar connect flow for Outlook. Microsoft shows this after the provider selects Outlook.</p></div></div></div>"
